# Byte-exact checkouts everywhere. Narration takes are content-addressed by
# the exact bytes of script.tsv, lexicon.json and alts.tsv; facts and oracle
# outputs are compared byte for byte; score stems are fingerprinted from the
# score sources. Git EOL normalization (autocrlf defaults to true on Windows)
# would silently rewrite those files at checkout and invalidate every hash,
# so conversion is disabled for the whole tree (as in franken_manim).
* -text

# Binary media that may appear under docs/media (README stills only).
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
